      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how gently the clinic team handles companion animals, including nervous and reactive dogs. Pet parents appreciate the thoughtful post-operative attention, soothing environment, and dedicated nursing care provided throughout recoveries and routine treatments."
      }
    },
